  "style": {
    "id": "barrier-grid",
    "name": "Barrier Grid",
    "description": "Scanimation: a cream card printed with six interlaced frames of a flapping bird in near-black navy (strip i = frame i mod 6) and a clear acetate sheet of bright opaque coral stripes, five strips opaque and one clear, lying a hair above it. Alone the card is a striped blur; with the sheet on, each slit shows one strip and so one frame: the bird is a bold dark shape of slivers on a bright coral-and-cream field. Slide the sheet and the bird flaps, by real occlusion: the card never changes. Two analytic shaders (the print and the barrier, both anti-aliased per pixel), a pale wooden desk, bright even light, navy ink, one teal spot colour for the secondary print.",
